WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Right-click workspace → Force window layout → Force tiled

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Force floating applies to existing and incoming windows

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Force modifier buttons → On shares always-visible workspace controls

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Off restores ordinary mode choices without undoing the current arrangement

